{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff8f04ce357de3b2fcbfc36e193e2b4d9f57d983eab021813e4cf200b8b073b6", "ja": "あ、いたいた、昴。\n今日は時間空いたぞ。キャッチボールするか！", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了，昴。\n我今天有空喔，来传接球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "f49f35df981112eb22527b39c8cf30e019391bde13fc275f765b10b0c5e32715", "ja": "え！？　い、いいよ{$P$}。\n今日は、やめておく……。", "zh": "咦！？不、不用啦{$P$}。\n今天就算了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8725088b83b6ceb5b3697cf467f66156dacfb9bd4e0f9c21b41952fe69e7aa18", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ昴、熱でもあるのか？", "zh": "怎么了，昴？你发烧了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9a5573b17dac2c96d50bd2999c60ad853750cc72b9b4c42493513e41176baae", "ja": "そ、そうじゃないんだけどさ……。\nえっと、最近いつも一緒だろ？　オレ達。", "zh": "不、不是那样啦……\n呃，最近我们一直在一起对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "28d02328c698d0e96a9e3f315297bb3fdabb8cc40535e74df2580ec955a1d58c", "ja": "昨日のレッスンもだし、この前の仕事だって、\n一緒にボート乗ったりとかさ……。", "zh": "昨天的训练也是，再更之前的工作也是，\n还一起搭小船……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "b8d5d161d2186eb7fd57f6fa5e595b9ecc031cc0b920b5b14d03640e1014a693", "ja": "そういうのって、なんか恥ずくない……？\nちょっと……べ、ベタベタしすぎっていうかさ……。", "zh": "你不觉得那样有点害羞吗……？\n好像有点……黏、黏太紧了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8fa6affa37867fb744e2f7940d1fe9e179f94d078ffd8749d88bb5add1c1160c", "ja": "いつも一緒にいるのはあたり前だろ？\n昴はアイドルで、俺はそのプロデューサーなんだから。", "zh": "一直在一起是理所当然的吧？\n因为昴是偶像，而我是你的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "03ae9cdc3559fe6fdd88cd974a108c9f1aeabda08f601125e2fbe0dfc6d5c351", "ja": "そ……そっか！　アイドルとプロデューサーだもんな。\nだから、いつも一緒でもいいんだ！", "zh": "这……这样啊！毕竟是偶像和制作人嘛。\n所以一直在一起也无所谓对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "41955fb5af1e823acb20a4d56022c702561a2eb957655a16e965adafb5fa93cd", "ja": "なんだ、心配しなくてよかったんだな！　オレ、\n{$P$}に甘えすぎかもって思ってさ。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来不用担心啊！\n我还在想我是不是太依赖{$P$}了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "1f4c722168f74ef64a02f7a4ddfa47d2df84b9c8db4e0d56093d3c81a134bc68", "ja": "は～～心配してソンした！\nもー、早く言ってくれよ、{$P$}♪", "zh": "唉～～白担心了！\n真是的，你早说嘛，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "611160241350904bc739af7c88ffdefee7cffc318d6303a7109158ea72d08b92", "ja": "す、すまん……というか、俺のせいなのか……？", "zh": "抱、抱歉……不过这是我的错吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "23c8c174a2fe05328219a283c80d17181a85de7141d936872fc77884411edcc5", "ja": "んじゃ、さっそくキャッチボールしようぜ！\nそれとも、草野球する？　ふたりだけだけどな！", "zh": "那就赶快来传接球吧！\n还是要打草地棒球？虽然只有两个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0033_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "45a1ad1dc0c88cfdb36a3e6a2f2fc7de4abad24d5ed9542366db1f45d07d8997", "ja": "ホラホラ、早く一緒に行こうぜ♪\n{$P$}！", "zh": "好啦，我们快点走吧♪\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
